{"3686130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Slopeside Kings", "steam_appid": 3686130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slopeside Kings</strong> is a <strong>multiplayer snowboarding combat racer for</strong> <strong>up to four players</strong>, where you shred the slopes, <strong>catch big air</strong>, and pull off <strong>tricks to build boost</strong>. Pickup and use <strong>chaotic items</strong> along the slopes to <strong>battle</strong> your way to the finish line!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Traverse several different slopes—each with ramps, obstacles, and the occasional shortcut.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/extras/73ce85afce033c00125fab5eac0e484e.poster.avif?t=1777460910\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/extras/73ce85afce033c00125fab5eac0e484e.webm?t=1777460910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/extras/73ce85afce033c00125fab5eac0e484e.mp4?t=1777460910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A tip from Yeti Mountain Ski Patrol:</i> <i><strong>AVOID THE ANIMALS</strong>.</i> They are <strong>not</strong> your friends; they will hit you, they will hurt you, and your fellow racers will not help you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/extras/d9735fb3eefb38b162f9c9285aea77ae.poster.avif?t=1777460910\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/extras/d9735fb3eefb38b162f9c9285aea77ae.webm?t=1777460910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/extras/d9735fb3eefb38b162f9c9285aea77ae.mp4?t=1777460910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use ramps to catch air and do tricks to build up your boost meter. Burn boost to speed past slower racers!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/extras/c729ee1a20a9723a72a2819e330f6251.poster.avif?t=1777460910\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/extras/c729ee1a20a9723a72a2819e330f6251.webm?t=1777460910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/extras/c729ee1a20a9723a72a2819e330f6251.mp4?t=1777460910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A tip from the Yeti Mountain Ski Patrol:</i> <i><strong>LAND YOUR TRICKS.</strong></i> Trust us, the snow is not as soft as it looks; you <strong>don’t</strong> want to hit it with your face. Make sure your <strong>board is under you</strong> and <strong>let go of all buttons</strong> to stick the landing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/extras/6a76d96a71d6fdc9023629cc8f9b10ca.poster.avif?t=1777460910\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/extras/6a76d96a71d6fdc9023629cc8f9b10ca.webm?t=1777460910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/extras/6a76d96a71d6fdc9023629cc8f9b10ca.mp4?t=1777460910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pick up backpacks and use the items inside to battle it out with the other racers!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/extras/72f2d2fa49103ae83f4847242334d52e.poster.avif?t=1777460910\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/extras/72f2d2fa49103ae83f4847242334d52e.webm?t=1777460910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/extras/72f2d2fa49103ae83f4847242334d52e.mp4?t=1777460910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A tip from Yeti Mountain Ski Patrol:</i> There are a wide variety of items available to Slopeside Kings contestants. As you race, try them out and learn the effects of each one, it could be the difference between winning and losing the race.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slopeside Kings</strong> is a <strong>multiplayer snowboarding combat racer for</strong> <strong>up to four players</strong>, where you shred the slopes, <strong>catch big air</strong>, and pull off <strong>tricks to build boost</strong>. Pickup and use <strong>chaotic items</strong> along the slopes to <strong>battle</strong> your way to the finish line!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Traverse several different slopes—each with ramps, obstacles, and the occasional shortcut.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/extras/73ce85afce033c00125fab5eac0e484e.poster.avif?t=1777460910\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/extras/73ce85afce033c00125fab5eac0e484e.webm?t=1777460910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/extras/73ce85afce033c00125fab5eac0e484e.mp4?t=1777460910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A tip from Yeti Mountain Ski Patrol:</i> <i><strong>AVOID THE ANIMALS</strong>.</i> They are <strong>not</strong> your friends; they will hit you, they will hurt you, and your fellow racers will not help you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/extras/d9735fb3eefb38b162f9c9285aea77ae.poster.avif?t=1777460910\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/extras/d9735fb3eefb38b162f9c9285aea77ae.webm?t=1777460910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/extras/d9735fb3eefb38b162f9c9285aea77ae.mp4?t=1777460910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use ramps to catch air and do tricks to build up your boost meter. Burn boost to speed past slower racers!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/extras/c729ee1a20a9723a72a2819e330f6251.poster.avif?t=1777460910\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/extras/c729ee1a20a9723a72a2819e330f6251.webm?t=1777460910\"