7460910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A tip from Yeti Mountain Ski Patrol:</i> There are a wide variety of items available to Slopeside Kings contestants. As you race, try them out and learn the effects of each one, it could be the difference between winning and losing the race.</p>", "short_description": "Slopeside Kings is a multiplayer snowboarding combat racer for up to four players, where you shred the slopes, catch big air, and pull off tricks to build boost. Pickup and use chaotic items along the slopes to battle your way to the finish line!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/fbdd6f8fcaf5a930977d001b3d4ebf9365307725/header.jpg?t=1777460910", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/9ecba60d363c84e8ed6116e48b263df53d86af79/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777460910", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/9ecba60d363c84e8ed6116e48b263df53d86af79/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777460910", "website": "https://slopesidegames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 Or Later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.4GHZ Dual Core Processor Or Higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 9800GT Or Higher<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 64-bit Recommended</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit proce